Package: RdistNN
Title: Generalized U-Statistics and Conditional Z-Estimation with
        Pluggable Scores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jakob", family = "Juergens", email = "info@jakobjuergens.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jakob Juergens [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jakob Juergens <info@jakobjuergens.com>
Description: Fast, extensible framework for generalized U-statistics and
    distance-localized Z-estimation with pluggable distance, rank-weight, and
    score interfaces. Includes user-level wrappers for local nonparametric
    regression, CATE estimation, and localized PLQR orthogonal moments via DNN
    rank weights. Uses compiled C++ fast paths when available and falls back to
    robust batched R evaluation otherwise, with variance estimation via delete-1
    jackknife.
